January 6

[LINK: (New England Revolution has taken part in several international competitions) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_England_Revolution_in_international_competition] .  [LINK: (New England Revolution) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_England_Revolution]  is an American  [LINK: (soccer) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Association_football]  club based in  [LINK: (Foxborough, Massachusetts) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foxborough,_Massachusetts] , which has competed in  [LINK: (Major League Soccer) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Major_League_Soccer]  (MLS) since the league's first season in 1996. The club has taken part five times in the  [LINK: (CONCACAF Champions Cup) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CONCACAF_Champions_Cup] ; they have reached the quarterfinals on three occasions.  [LINK: (In 2008) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2008%E2%80%9309_CONCACAF_Champions_League] , they lost to  [LINK: (Joe Public F.C.) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joe_Public_F.C.] , marking the first time an MLS side had lost to a Caribbean one.  [LINK: (In 2022) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_CONCACAF_Champions_League] , they lost to  [LINK: (Pumas UNAM) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pumas_UNAM]  in a  [LINK: (penalty shootout) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penalty_shoot-out_(association_football)]  after winning the first leg 3–0. From 2008 to 2010, the club participated in the  [LINK: (SuperLiga) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_American_SuperLiga] , an annual competition between MLS and  [LINK: (Liga MX) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liga_MX]  (the first-division Mexican league). They won the  [LINK: (2008 edition of the tournament) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2008_North_American_SuperLiga] , winning  [LINK: (the final) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2008_North_American_SuperLiga_final]  against the  [LINK: (Houston Dynamo) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Houston_Dynamo_FC] . The club also reached the final of the  [LINK: (2010 SuperLiga) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010_North_American_SuperLiga] , which they lost to  [LINK: (Atlético Morelia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atl%C3%A9tico_Morelia] . Since 2023, they have participated in the  [LINK: (Leagues Cup) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leagues_Cup] , another annual tournament between the two leagues. ( [LINK: (Full article...) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_England_Revolution_in_international_competition] )

